Project Title
LegalEaseAI – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

1. Introduction
Testing is an important phase of the LegalEaseAI project.

The main purpose of testing is to verify that the application works correctly and produces the expected output.

2. Testing Objectives
Verify that the application starts correctly.
Verify that the home page loads properly.
Verify that user inputs are accepted.
Verify that required fields are validated.
Verify that the Generate button works correctly.
Verify that the legal document is generated.
Verify that the result page displays correctly.
Verify that the document can be downloaded.
Verify that invalid inputs are handled properly.
Verify that API keys are protected.
3. Test Cases
